    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOH2Qg5s8AAAABASZoZg",
      "title": "p2p/nat: migrate STUN networking to Pion v3",
      "author": "falcorocks",
      "number": 807,
      "body": "## Summary\n\n- migrate the NAT STUN client from Pion v2 to Pion v3\n- select the first patched STUN v3.1.5 and DTLS v3.1.4 releases\n- remove the legacy STUN v2, DTLS v2, and transport v2/v3 modules from the resolved dependency graph\n- regenerate the root and keeper module graphs\n\n## Validation\n\n- `make all`\n- `go run ./build/ci.go test`\n- `go run ./build/ci.go lint`\n- `go run ./build/ci.go check_generate`\n- `go run ./build/ci.go check_baddeps`\n- `go mod verify` in the root and keeper modules\n- verified the resolved and compiled P2P dependency graph contains STUN v3.1.5 and DTLS v3.1.4 with no legacy STUN or DTLS v2 modules",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/op-geth",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-19T13:36:30Z",
